  "summary": "Across the Waters Bandstorm blows, waters scarce. In a remote mining town without any radio signals, a quirky teenage girl gets curious about a passing truck driver. Screaming Metal Ewelina is a Polish truck driver who meets ever tighter delivery deadlines. Alif is a young Iraqi hiding in the back of his vehicle. The only thing linking them is a CO2 detector fixed to the side of the truck. The race against time has begun&hellip; Cairo Standstill Few days before their irreversible immigration from Egypt, a Cairine couple struggle to sell their car. When they finally are about to finalize a deal, a double-parked car, blocking their own car from exiting, jeopardizes the sale. Stuck in the chaot",
